name: ['Basking Rootwalla', 'Cabal Coffers', 'Deep Analysis', 'Engineered Plague', 'Firebolt', 'Force Spike', "Gerrard's Verdict", 'Goblin Legionnaire', 'Goblin Ringleader', 'Roar of the Wurm', 'Wing Shards', 'Wonder']
