rarity: ['Rare']
text: ['As Engineered Plague enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nAll creatures of the chosen type get -1/-1.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.', 'Create a 6/6 green Wurm creature token.\\nFlashback {3}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Firebolt deals 2 damage to any target.\\nFlashback {4}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Flying\\nAs long as Wonder is in your graveyard and you control an Island, creatures you control have flying.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nWhen Goblin Ringleader enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all Goblin cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Target player discards two cards. You gain 3 life for each land card discarded this way.', 'Target player draws two cards.\\nFlashback—{1}{U}, Pay 3 life. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target player sacrifices an attacking creature.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', '{1}{G}: Basking Rootwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.\\nMadness {0} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', '{2}, {T}: Add {B} for each Swamp you control.', '{R}, Sacrifice Goblin Legionnaire: It deals 2 damage to any target.\\n{W}, Sacrifice Goblin Legionnaire: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.']
flavor: ['"The admixture of bitterwort in the viral brew has produced most favorable results."\\n—Phyrexian progress notes', '"The awestruck birds gazed at Wonder. Slowly, timidly, they rose into the air."\\n—*Scroll of Beginnings*', '"The specimen seems to be broken."', 'A heart of light and a soul of darkness cannot coexist.', "Deep within the Cabal's vault, the Mirari pulsed like a dead sun-and its darkness radiated across Otaria.", 'Reach out and torch someone.']
